<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Blinded soul, I cannot see</l><l>What this world has done to me;</l><l>My heart grows cold and life would bleed;</l><l>Then He comes, knocks on my door,</l><l>Through the saints—and there they stand</l><l>With the Lord, oh, for my need!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
